        "en": "Valid values:\n\n- **VERSION_TEST**: system version test message push\n- **SYSTEM_UPDATE**: system version release message push\n- **APP_VERSION_TEST**: application self-upgrade test message push\n- **APP_VERSION_UPDATE**: application self-upgrade release message push."
